#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-print-dev-env.md:50
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-print-dev-env.md:52
msgid ""
"This command prints a shell script that can be sourced by `bash` and that "
"sets the variables and shell functions defined by the build process of "
"[_installable_](./nix.md#installables). This allows you to get a similar "
"build environment in your current shell rather than in a subshell (as with "
"`nix develop`)."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-print-dev-env.md:58
msgid ""
"With `--json`, the output is a JSON serialisation of the variables and "
"functions defined by the build process."
msgstr ""

